            # bundles arsenal+loft+weak-arm (the #2-4 separators). pitch_vuln separates too
            # (+2.77/+8.41) and was only a GATE -> now ranks. platoon DROPPED (dead: +0.05 over a full
            # season). recent form kept light. THE GUY/GO rank by this, so they now reflect it.
            # NIKKO-VALIDATED-TWEAKS: recent_iso_delta dropped -- added NOTHING on top of mix
            # (stack_on_mix: recent/loft ~0 for HR) and read noisy on the board. amp = mix + matchup_z + vuln.
            # NIKKO-TIER-WEIGHTS: per-tier amp (weight_test_boards, both-halves). Power is the given up top
