    # ADDITIVE-MATCHUP: break the season-power ceiling. The score was 78% season-led because
    # matchup only MULTIPLIES the season base. This adds an ADDITIVE matchup-confluence term
    # so a good-power bat in an ELITE matchup can outrank a great bat in a bad spot — validated
    # on graded boards (top-N HR 10.3%->14.7%, promoted bats 17.2% vs demoted 8.6%).
    # Barrel-gated so powerless bats can't ride a matchup. ADD_W tunable (retune on clean
